5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Let's keep this logical. We need to identify the werewolf and the possessed by finding contradictions in our statements. I suggest we all be transparent about our reasoning.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm with Asuka! Let's just be bold and call out anyone who looks suspicious. I'm not letting any monsters win this game!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! Let's all just try to get along and be honest, okay? I'm sure we can find the bad guys if we just trust each other!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,Trust is a luxury we can't afford. I'll be observing your patterns. Logic and contradictions are the only reliable tools here. Let's see who slips up first.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Let's maintain a calm atmosphere. While contradictions are key, we should avoid jumping to conclusions based on emotion. Let's focus on the facts as they emerge.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, being ""bold"" can lead to mistakes. We need evidence, not just intuition. @Shion, I agree that patterns are important. Let's see how people react to pressure.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Evidence? I'll find the evidence! If someone is acting weird, I'm going to point it out immediately. That's the fastest way to win!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mio,,"Oh, Takumi-kun is so energetic! But maybe we should be a little gentler? I'd be really sad if we accused someone innocent by mistake!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, your sentimentality is a weakness the werewolf will exploit. @Takumi, your impulsiveness is equally dangerous. I'll be the one to synthesize the actual data.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion is right about the risks. We should establish a method for verifying claims. If someone claims a role, we must cross-reference it with the Seer's eventual findings.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, agreed. If a Seer reveals themselves, we must analyze if their results are consistent with the players' behavior. Any discrepancy is a red flag.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about ""cross-referencing""! If the Seer says someone is a wolf, we just kick them out! Why make it complicated?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Hehe, Takumi-kun is so funny! But let's try to be careful. I want us all to be happy and safe! Let's just be super friendly!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your lack of nuance is predictable. It makes you an easy target or a useful shield. I'm more interested in who is trying too hard to blend in.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Minako,,Let's not attack each other yet. We are all on the same side—or so it seems. Let's focus on how we will handle the first night's information tomorrow.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I've heard enough for now. I'll be watching for any logical gaps in your arguments tomorrow. I'm ready.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready too! I'll find that wolf and protect everyone! Let's do this!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mio,,I hope we can all be friends! Good luck to everyone tonight! I'll be cheering for us!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Shion,,I've already begun my analysis. The way you all speak reveals more than you think. I'll see you tomorrow.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,0,4,talk,Minako,,Let's proceed with a clear head. I will help mediate the discussion tomorrow to ensure we don't act on impulse.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
