33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The first night is over. If the Seer has information, they should consider how to present it without becoming an immediate target for the werewolf.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Who's the Seer?! Just tell us! If you know who the wolf is, tell us right now so we can get rid of them!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Wow, Takumi-kun is still so fired up! But maybe the Seer is scared? We should make them feel safe so they can help us!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your desperation is loud. A real Seer wouldn't just shout a name without a strategy. I've already confirmed one person is human.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, are you claiming to be the Seer? If so, please tell us who you checked and the result. It's the most efficient way to start.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, if you are the Seer, your claim is a bold move. If you're the werewolf, you're trying to seize control of the narrative. Which is it?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Shion is the Seer! I knew it! Okay, Shion, tell us who the wolf is! I'm ready to vote them out!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Mio,,Shion-san is so cool and mysterious! I believe you! Please tell us something that will help us save everyone!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I checked Takumi. He is human. While his behavior is irritating, he is not the werewolf. Now, let's see who tries to discredit this information.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Takumi is human. That narrows it down. However, we must remember the Possessed also appears human. We still have a wolf and a possessed among us.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, confirming Takumi as human is a safe play. It builds trust with the loudest person. But it doesn't tell us who the wolf is.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"See! I told you I was a good guy! Now that we know I'm safe, let's look at the others. @Mio, you're being way too nice, it's suspicious!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Eh?! Takumi-kun, that's mean! I'm just trying to keep everyone happy! How can being nice be a bad thing? I'm so sad now!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mio's reaction is a bit excessive, but @Takumi's accusation is baseless. I'm more interested in @Asuka's skepticism. She's analyzing me very closely.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, please refrain from baseless accusations. @Asuka is simply being thorough. We should look for someone who is actively trying to divert attention.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I am skeptical because it is the only logical stance. If Shion is the wolf, they've just secured Takumi's loyalty. I suspect Shion or Mio.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"What?! Asuka, you're doubting Shion? Shion is the one helping us! I think Asuka is the one trying to confuse us! I'm voting Asuka!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I can't believe we're fighting already! I don't want to vote for anyone, but if we have to, I'll follow what feels right... this is so scary!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, your attempt to cast doubt on me is a classic diversion. You're trying to paint my logic as a ""wolf's strategy."" It's quite transparent.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Minako,,"The tension is rising. Asuka's suspicion is logical, but Takumi's reaction is emotional. I believe we should examine Asuka's claims more carefully before voting.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
