66,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"We got her! Asuka was acting way too suspicious, trying to make Shion look bad. Now we just have to find the wolf!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Oh no, Asuka-san is gone... it's so sad! I really hope we didn't make a mistake. I'm shaking just thinking about it!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,1,talk,Shion,,"Asuka's execution was a necessary result of her attempt to destabilize the group's trust in the Seer. Now, the truth becomes much simpler.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
