70,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"Yeah, Shion! Tell us! Who else is a human? Or did you finally find the wolf? I'm ready to kick them out right now!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,Mio,,"Please tell us something good, Shion-san! I want this to be over so we can all go home and be happy again!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Shion,,"I divined Mio. She is the werewolf. Her ""innocent"" act was a clumsy mask. The game ends here.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Mio is the werewolf? That is a significant revelation. If Shion is indeed the Seer, the village wins by executing Mio.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
